OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 16 MAR
OL,4,G2100FThe Blues Show with Cerys Matthews
OL,5,     GGuitarist and producer Robin
OL,6,     GTrower, former member of Procol
OL,7,     GHarum, joins Cerys to share his
OL,8,     Gfavourite blues records and chat
OL,9,     Gabout the upcoming 50th
OL,10,     Gcelebration of his Live! album.
OL,11,G2200FThe Good Groove with DJ Spoony
OL,12,     GFeel-good tunes to make you
OL,13,     Ggroove. 'Dr. Beat' is also on
OL,14,     Ghand to prescribe a perfect tune
OL,15,     Gfor a listener whose week hasn't
OL,16,     Ggot off to the best start!
OL,17,G0000FOJ Borg
OL,18,     GOJ is live through the night from
OL,19,     Gthe Salford Riviera with Midnight
OL,20,     GMastermind, Wish You Were There
OL,21,     Gand the first Midnight Caller of
OL,22,     Gthe week.
